  "note": "The PART MAP for the segmented Colossus. `tools/segment_parts.py` derived every name in it from the geometry's own bounds \u2014 nothing here is keyed to a GLTF_n index, because a re-export renumbers those and does not move the parts. The `source` field records which geometry each name WAS in the delivered file so a later reader can go back to it.",
